ad, pelo cardado, ropa colorida en lugar del negro obrero. Voz dulce sin gruñidos, armonías al modo de Aerosmith y Kiss, letras de amor y lujuria con nombres de chica y, sobre todo, la power ballad, que entra en radios que excluían el heavy y gana público nuevo, como las versiones blancas de Pat Boone en los cincuenta. MTV impulsó mucho su desarrollo. Se queda con la herencia dionisíaca y elimina el caos: «lo realmente pesado se quita».","color":"#f472b6","family":"Lite metal: glam y pop metal","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/HeavyMetal/#lite-metal"}],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Glam Metal Band","body":"Ratt is identified as a glam metal band, a direct descendant of glam rock and hair metal. \"rat twisted sister.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Surprising History of Glam Rock","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=blDNqVFheAw"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":269816140716483,"type":"song","name":"Round and Round","work_year":1984,"list_id":26942126325510,"list":"Billboard Year-End 1984","src":"singles","rank":87,"year":1984,"note":"","yt":"0u8teXR8VE4","scaruffi":null},{"id":269816140716483,"type":"song","name":"Round and Round","work_year":1984,"list_id":132335824845498,"list":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","src":"charts","rank":87,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"0u8teXR8VE4","scaruffi":null},{"id":112694370151261,"type":"album","name":"Out of the Cellar","list_id":53255468861993,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Glam Metal","src":"musthear","rank":23,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"ZdZobiQgdxU","scaruffi":null},{"id":112694370151261,"type":"album","name":"Out of the Cellar","list_id":175553778159156,"list":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Sunset Strip Glam Metal","src":"musthear","rank":12,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"ZdZobiQgdxU","scaruffi":null},{"id":39302187809094,"type":"album","name":"Invasion of Your Privacy","list_id":53255468861993,"list":